{"articleNo":"164594","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=164594&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2017 대학 신입학생 국가유공자 보훈장학 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.01.10","hit":"3363","attachments":[{"name":"장학금지급신청서 서식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=164594&attachNo=5424"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong> 2017학년도&nbsp; 대학 신입학생 합격자 국가유공자 보훈장학금 신청안내</strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2017학년도 신입학 합격자중 국가유공자(본인, 배우자, 자녀)는 보훈장학금을</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;아래와 같이 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다. </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;1. 제출서류 :&nbsp;&nbsp; 대학입학금 및 수업료 면제대상자증명서 1부.(해당보훈청발행)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 장학금 지급신청서 (붙임서식 참조)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 제출방법 :&nbsp; 1) 우편등기 &nbsp;:&nbsp; 경북 구미시&nbsp; 대학로 61 금오공과대학교 학생처(본관 101호)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;장학담당자(장학서류 재중)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong> 2) &nbsp;Fax : 054-478-7064 </strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 제출기한 :&nbsp; <strong>2017. 1. 20(금) 까지 </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 등록금 납부안내 : 보훈장학생은&nbsp; 고지서에 전액 등록금이 면제되어 고지서가 발급됩니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><strong> 등록금 납부할 금액이 \"0\"으로 없으나, 은행에 수납 등록처리 하여야 합니다.</strong></font></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#4641d9\">은행에 수납처리 하지 않을시 등록금 미납으로 처리되어 입학이 취소되오니, </font></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#4641d9\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#4641d9\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#4641d9\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 반드시, 등록금 납부기간내에 은행에 수납처리 하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>붙임화일 : 장학금지급신청서(서식) </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>문의 ☎ 054-478-7045 </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
